User-facing limits
History retains at most30 steps total backward/forward within512KiB per desk; normal history persists, private history stays in memory. It begins with available state and cannot reconstruct an old lost grid without a checkpoint. Closed tabs are not resurrected.
AI percentages are source-reported estimates where marked; absent percentages remain indeterminate. Ordinary web chats require API integration. Stop controls the current owned Agent session, not an arbitrary external agent process. Local model fixtures do not verify the owner's model/API account.
Supported document formats are PDF, DOCX, XLSX and UTF-8 TXT/MD/CSV/TSV/JSON with bounded edits. No full Word layout engine or full Excel calculator, legacy binary DOC/XLS, macros or encrypted Office package support. PDF edits add annotations/text/rotation, not original-text editing, OCR or secure redaction. Unsaved drafts reside in memory; explicit saved copies remain on disk, including from private mode.
Normal search choice persists; each private session inherits it, holds overrides only in RAM and resets on re-entry. Preserve existing valid explicit preferences; Google is the clean-profile default.
This is an Apple Silicon preview with ad-hoc signing, without Developer ID or Apple notarization.
